// Notation: what is written on a staff, as data.
//
// The distinction this subtree keeps is the layering table's first row —
// written pitch is not MIDI number, notated duration is not performed
// duration. A module here says what a reader sees; what a player does with it
// belongs to a performance profile, and a module that answered both would be
// answering a performance question with a notation answer.

mod staff;
